/P 89 0 R
/E (The frontend is built with React 19 and TypeScript, bundled by Vite, and styled with Tailwind CSS 4. It contains three separate portal interfaces, each guarded by its own authentication context \(AuthContext, PsychiatristAuthContext, InstitutionAuthContext\) and protected route components. React Router v7 handles all client-side navigation, while TanStack React Query manages server state, caching, and background data refetching. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
