/E (MongoDB serves as the primary database, accessed through Mongoose ODM. The seven collections are User, DailyCheckIn, Appointment, Availability, Psychiatrist, Institution, and Meeting. Schemas include pre-validation hooks \(e.g., auto-computing totalScore in DailyCheckIn from seven metric scores\), pre-save middleware \(password hashing with bcrypt\), and compound indexes for query optimization. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
